    "title": "Woman sentenced after killing married couple in DUI crash in Bullitt Co. - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ken Howlett ,\n1 hours ago A woman convicted of killing a married couple in a DUI crash in Bullitt County has been sentenced. The crash happened June 5, 2024, at the intersection of Preston Highway and Old Preston Highway in Hillview when Dawn M. Middleton, 33, of Taylorsville, drove through a flashing red light on Preston Highway while she was on her cellphone, according to a report by WDRB+WAVE.com. Read full article",
